                                                    hapticFeedback.performHapticFeedback(
                                                        HapticFeedbackType.GestureEnd
                                                    )
                                                }
                                            ), onClick = {}) {
                                            Icon(
                                                painterResource(R.drawable.ic_drag_handle_rounded),
                                                "",
                                                tint = Color.Gray
                                            )
                                        }
                                    }
                                }
                            }
